  "description": "I like stars. They say that if you see a shooting star, your wish will come true. Although my wish of having the same feelings as the person I like has never been granted... ..But this wish has never been granted?! I didn't mean to bring a sex-crazed alien into my house!! \n\n\"Yo-Han's emotional energy is especially delicious. If you let me feed it until I have enough energy to return to my home planet... I'll grant Yo-Han what he wants, too.\"\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
